DESCRIPTION:FREESeniors’ stretch and strength program builds independenc
 e by improving balance\, mobility\, and daily function through controlled 
 exercises like seated stretches\, bodyweight movements. The program focuse
 s on increasing flexibility\, muscle mass\, and coordination to prevent fa
 lls\, reduce stiffness\, and enhance overall well-being\, often incorporat
 ing warm-ups\, strength sets with modifications (like chair support) and c
 ooldowns with deep breathing.Fall 2026 session:Tuesdays: 11 am – 12 pm T
 hursday
